:: Statement-only formalization of Logipedia corpus artifact
:: connectives.or_intror (logipedia__mizar__connectives.or_intror), catalog
:: title "connectives.or_intror": right introduction of disjunction for
:: arbitrary propositions. This file contains no proof.

environ
begin

::$P-
scheme ConnectivesOrIntror { SourceA[], SourceB[] } :
  SourceB[] implies (SourceA[] or SourceB[])
proof
end;
::$P+
